teather (0.1.0-4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * D-022: NetworkManager owns the non-persistent teather0 tun connection from
    creation (tun.owner delegation), replacing D-021's externally-assumed
    interface and its non-functional Reapply DNS.
  * DNS is now additive and non-exclusive: the physical link's resolver stays
    first while it is present; the Teather sentinel is only used once it is gone.
  * Remove the setuid-root helper and its polkit action; the packet engine runs
    unprivileged. Restore NoNewPrivileges=yes on the user unit.
  * Add the auto-failover setting (teather failover on|off), default on.

 -- Teather Project <noreply@example.invalid>  Sat, 29 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

